fo admonition_o5H7 alert alert--info"><div class="admonitionHeading_FzoX"><span class="admonitionIcon_rXq6"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z"></path></svg></span>info</div><div class="admonitionContent_Knsx"><p>Useful information.</p></div></div>{"\n"}<div class="playgroundContainer_TDLX" data-mm-live={"{\"code\":\"function Button() {\\n  return (\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" onClick={() => alert('hey')}>\\n      Click me!\\n    </button>\\n  );\\n}\",\"compiled\":\"\\\"use strict\\\";return (function Button() {\\n  return (\\n    React.createElement('button', { type: \\\"button\\\", onClick: () => alert('hey'),}, \\\"Click me!\\\"\\n\\n    )\\n  );\\n})\",\"noInline\":false,\"language\":\"tsx\"}"}><div class="playgroundHeader_h_Hu"><div class="playgroundHeaderContent_epzO">Live Editor</div><div class="playgroundHeaderButtons_RTSm"><button type="button" aria-label="Reset code to original" title="Reset" class="clean-btn resetButton_gKmz"><svg class="resetButtonIcon_B9AZ" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3a5 5 0 1 0 4.546 2.914.5.5 0 0 1 .908-.417A6 6 0 1 1 8 2v1z"></path><path d="M8 4.466V.534a.25.25 0 0 1 .41-.192l2.36 1.966c.12.1.12.284 0 .384L8.41 4.658A.25.25 0 0 1 8 4.466z"></path></svg>Reset</button></div></div><div class="playgroundEditor_uqZ4"><pre class="prism-code language-tsx" spellcheck="false" style="margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 10px; font-family: inherit; color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); tab-size: 2; white-space: pre-wrap;" contenteditable="plaintext-only"><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token keyword" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">function</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token function" style="color: rgb(130, 80, 223);">Button</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">)</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#123;</span><span class="token plain"></span>{"\n"}</span><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token keyword" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">return</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token plain"></span>{"\n"}</span><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&lt;</span><span class="token tag" style="color: rgb(34, 134, 58);">button</span><span class="token tag" style="color: rgb(34, 134, 58);"> </span><span class="token tag attr-name" style="color: rgb(5, 80, 174);">type</span><span class="token tag attr-value punctuation attr-equals" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">=</span><span class="token tag attr-value punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">"</span><span class="token tag attr-value" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">button</span><span class="token tag attr-value punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">"</span><span class="token tag" style="color: rgb(34, 134, 58);"> </span><span class="token tag attr-name" style="color: rgb(5, 80, 174);">onClick</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript script-punctuation punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">=</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#123;</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">)</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript" style="color: rgb(36, 41, 46);"> </span><span class="token tag script language-javascript arrow operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">=&gt;</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript" style="color: rgb(36, 41, 46);"> </span><span class="token tag script language-javascript function" style="color: rgb(130, 80, 223);">alert</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'hey'</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">)</span><span class="token tag script language-javascript punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#125;</span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&gt;</span><span class="token plain-text"></span>{"\n"}</span><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain-text">      Click me!</span>{"\n"}</span><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain-text">    </span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&lt;/</span><span class="token tag" style="color: rgb(34, 134, 58);">button</span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&gt;</span><span class="token plain"></span>{"\n"}</span><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">;</span><span class="token plain"></span>{"\n"}</span><span class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#125;</span>{"\n"}</span></pre></div><div class="playgroundHeader_h_Hu"><div class="playgroundHeaderContent_epzO">Result</div></div><div class="playgroundPreview_u2xE"><div>Loading...</div></div></div>{"\n"}<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="using-absolute-path">Using absolute path<a href="#using-absolute-path" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Using absolute path" title="Direct link to Using absolute path" translate="no">​</a></h3>{"\n"}<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="data:image/png;base64," width="200" height="200" class="img_vXGZ" /></p>{"\n"}<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="tab">Tab<a href="#tab" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Tab" title="Direct link to Tab" translate="no">​</a></h3>{"\n\n\n"}<div class="theme-tabs-container tabList_Qoir" data-mm-tabs={"{\"values\":[\"apple\",\"orange\",\"banana\"]}"}><ul role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="tabs"><li role="tab" tabindex="0" aria-selected="true" class="tabs__item tabItem_AQgk tabs__item--active">Apple</li><li role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false" class="tabs__item tabItem_AQgk">Orange</li><li role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false" class="tabs__item tabItem_AQgk">Banana</li></ul><div class="margin-top--md"><div role="tabpanel" class="tabItem_pnkT"><p>This is an apple 🍎</p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabItem_pnkT" hidden=""><p>This is an orange 🍊</p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabItem_pnkT" hidden=""><p>This is a banana 🍌</p></div></div></div>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="comments">Comments<a href="#comments" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Comments" title="Direct link to Comments" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p>MDX comment: </p>{"\n"}<p>MDX comment in JSX:</p>{"\n"}<div><p>TEST</p></div>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="import-code-block-from-source-code-file">Import code block from source code file<a href="#import-code-block-from-source-code-file" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Import code block from source code file" title="Direct link to Import code block from source code file" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n\n\n"}<p>Let's say you have a React component.</p>{"\n"}<p>You can import and use it in MDX:</p>{"\n"}<div class="language-jsx codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;"><div class="codeBlockTitle_U6Q0">myMarkdownFile.mdx</div><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);" class="prism-code language-jsx codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token keyword module" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">import</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token imports maybe-class-name">MyComponent</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword module" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">from</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'./myComponent'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain" style="display: inline-block;"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&lt;</span><span class="token tag class-name" style="color: rgb(17, 99, 41);">MyComponent</span><span class="token tag" style="color: rgb(34, 134, 58);"> </span><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">/&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">;</span><br /></div></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup_KXnS"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_gMWc" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_